 readiness and insights features\n\n- Adds a comprehensive QoS system with per-expert caps, admin overrides, automated reminders, and a soft-degrade path for tenants.\n- Implements a unified streaming interface to support a dual-write migration from Redis to Kafka.\n- Introduces enterprise-grade crypto and audit features, including daily Merkle-root anchoring for audit logs, automated JWKS rotation for runbook signing, and a KMS-based envelope encryption service.\n- Scaffolds the v1 DSAR/RTBF compliance endpoints and backend worker infrastructure.\n- Deploys the first version of the Graph AI link-prediction engine for router hinting.\n- Includes extensive documentation, runbooks, monitoring dashboards, and automated CI/CD workflows for all new features.", "tree": {"sha": "4756f3d6e9cd74675bb6129f8fb3c8324c52077b", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/BrianCLong/summit/git/trees/4756f3d6e9cd74675bb6129f8fb3c8324c52077b"}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/BrianCLong/summit/git/commits/b8f08107b6101c933c07405546ade08a9b65c007", "comment_count": 0, "verification": {"verified": false, "reason": "unsigned", "signature": null, "payload": null, "verified_at": null}}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/BrianCLong/summit/commits/b8f08107b6101c933c07405546ade08a9b65c007", "html_url": "https://github.com/BrianCLong/summit/commit/b8f08107b6101c933c07405546ade08a9b65c007", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/BrianCLong/summit/commits/b8f08107b6101c933c07405546ade08a9b65c007/comments", "author": null, "committer": null, "parents": [{"sha": "1afdadce4a8ae45417c1c5cc62e443a0f0375a41", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/BrianCLong/summit/commits/1afdadce4a8ae45417c1c5cc62e443a0f0375a41", "html_url": "https://github.com/BrianCLong/summit/commit/1afdadce4a8ae45417c1c5cc62e443a0f0375a41"}]}]